<section class="on-ink angled angled-gold">
  <div class="wrap has-dots"><svg class="deco dots dots-steps" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#dotp)"/></svg>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="rv" style="--d:0"><b>Send us your interest</b><span>Fill out the form below so we can add you to Remind and our email list.</span></li>
      <li class="rv" style="--d:1"><b>Come to a meeting</b><span>In the fall we meet Tuesdays and Fridays 3:20–5:00 and Saturdays 10:00–2:00 in our workshop at Los Alamitos High.</span></li>
      <li class="rv" style="--d:2"><b>Pick a subteam and learn</b><span>Try mechanical, electrical, programming, or business. Fall training gets you ready for build season in January.</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="sec-deco" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap join-grid">
    <div class="faq rv" id="faq"><span class="deco feather f-faq px" data-depth="1.1" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="float" style="--r:16deg;--dur:7.5s;--dl:0.4s" viewBox="0 0 48 32"><use href="#feather"/></svg></span>
      <h2 class="ruled title-calm">FAQ</h2>
      <details><summary>Do I need any experience?</summary><p>No. We train every new member in the fall, and students teach students. Curiosity matters more than knowing how to use a lathe.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When and where do you meet?</summary><p>We meet in our workshop at Los Alamitos High School. In the fall: Tuesdays and Fridays 3:20–5:00 and Saturdays 10:00–2:00. During build season the shop is open every weekday after school until about 6:30–7:00, and Saturdays 10:00–4:00.</p></details>
      <details><summary>I'm not into engineering. Is there a place for me?</summary><p>Yes. Our business, outreach, and media subteams run sponsorships, the website, social media, photography, and awards submissions.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I join mid-year?</summary><p>Yes. Reach out and we'll get you caught up. Our summer camp is also a great way to start before freshman year.</p></details>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-card still rv" style="--d:1"><form class="form pc-in" id="apply" novalidate aria-labelledby="form-h">
      <h3 id="form-h">Interest form</h3>
      <div class="field"><label for="f-name">Name</label><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" aria-describedby="f-name-err" required><span class="err" id="f-name-err" hidden>Enter your name.</span></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="f-email">Email</label><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="f-email-err" required><span class="err" id="f-email-err" hidden>Enter an email address like name@example.com.</span></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="f-grade">Grade next year</label><select id="f-grade" name="grade"><option>8th (incoming freshman)</option><option>9th</option><option>10th</option><option>11th</option><option>12th</option><option>Parent / guardian</option></select></div>
      <fieldset class="checks"><legend>Interested in</legend>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="i-mech" value="Mechanical">Mechanical</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="i-elec" value="Electrical">Electrical</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="i-prog" value="Programming">Programming</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="i-biz" value="Business">Business &amp; media</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="i-unsure" value="Not sure">Not sure yet</label>
      </fieldset>
      <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Send interest form</button>
      <p class="note">For Los Al USD students and families. Also join our Remind: <strong>@FRC-6220</strong>.</p>
      <p class="ok" id="form-ok" role="status" hidden></p>
    </form></div>
  </div>
</section>
